      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data12/P183.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is J. Bourgoin, Arabic Geometrical Pattern and Design (1879; Dover reprint), plate 183, with no known building; his page also links David Wade’s photograph BOU 183."
