    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The lines through B and D, and H and K, cross the horizontal line at Z. Draw a circle with centre A through Z, and one with centre Z through A. They cross at U1 and U2. Draw a straight line through U1 and U2. Turn it round O by 36°, nine times. These lines are the far sides of the pentagons round the star.",
